※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4615 LANG_ARENA_VALUE_GIVEN_BACK

※ What a `match` takes out of a value points where the value did: text a result carried was
※ made where the result was.

fn g(a: &mut arena) → str ? i32 in a:
    "x" ⧺ "y" in a
@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let s: mut arena = ⎕arena
    defer ⎕empty(s)
    let r: str ? i32 = g(&mut s)
    match r:
        str(v):
            ⎕empty(s)
            if v = "xy": 0u6 else: 1u6
        ⊥:
            2u6
